        <object id="table_payment_allocations" label="" kind="table" entity="payment_allocations" group="Cash" tooltip="Assigns all or part of a bank transaction to one or more tax cases.&#10;Each allocation is an immutable additive event with its own ID and unique action reference; multiple allocations may link the same payment and case. allocated_pence &gt; 0.&#10;Sum of allocations cannot exceed the payment amount.&#10;An allocation must concern the payment owner's own cases under the proposed scope.&#10;Unallocated cash remains visible separately.&#10;A single transfer can cover several cases; each case can receive several instalments.">
