        <object id="table_odometer_readings" label="" kind="table" entity="odometer_readings" group="Evidence" tooltip="Stores mileage evidence from an MOT, handover or tax-period boundary.&#10;Reading kinds: MOT, HANDOVER, PERIOD_BOUNDARY.&#10;Accepted readings are retained; corrections create successor records.&#10;One handover reading can close the seller's assessment and open the buyer's.&#10;Unknown or unverified readings never become zero-mile evidence.&#10;New assessments use current accepted evidence. A correction supersedes the previous observation in the same vehicle-specific chain; historical assessments retain their original references.">
