        <object id="table_tax_assessments" label="" kind="table" entity="tax_assessments" group="Tax" tooltip="Records an issued tax decision and the exact evidence used to calculate it.&#10;At most one current issued assessment per case; drafts do not replace issued decisions.&#10;Both current accepted readings must match the case vehicle and assessed boundaries.&#10;Amounts and calculation evidence are immutable once issued; revisions supersede explicitly.&#10;Reading references are not globally unique, so revisions and adjacent cases can reuse evidence.&#10;Assessments and declarations both belong to the same stable case; assessed liability uses actual evidence and is not tied to a changeable estimate.">
